OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARunner walks final London Marathon
OL,4,Amile six months on
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe completed the "unofficial" final
OL,7,Fmile on Sunday, walking through the
OL,8,Fcapital by Buckingham Place and along
OL,9,FThe Mall with family, friends and
OL,10,Fsupporters, a month after leaving
OL,11,Fhospital.
OL,13,FHe said he was "nervous", adding:
OL,14,F"Everyone calls me a hero, that I
OL,15,Finspire people, I just feel happy it
OL,16,Fwent really well and it was a lot
OL,17,Fbetter than I thought."
